        104.87999725341797,
        79.92572021484375,
        429.9506530761719,
        93.2772216796875
      ],
      "text": "Convening of stakeholders (including professional associations) to:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.59762573242188,
        91.36740112304688,
        91.59762573242188
      ],
      "text": "l",
