      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        99.7257080078125,
        513.4099731445312,
        113.19220733642578
      ],
      "text": "analyse the capacity (public and private sector) at national and sub-national  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        113.52569580078125,
        290.4479064941406,
        126.877197265625
      ],
      "text": "levels to implement the guidelines;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        132.9949951171875,
        513.409912109375,
        146.4615020751953
      ],
      "text": "identify and quantify factors that may constrain or facilitate successful  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        146.79498291015625,
        200.9893798828125,
        160.146484375
      ],
      "text": "implementation;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        166.26434326171875,
        451.51702880859375,
        179.73085021972656
      ],
      "text": "develop national (or sub-national) policies and obtain endorsement. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        187.93359375,
        444.1876220703125,
        201.28509521484375
      ],
      "text": "Development of a plan for implementation and evaluation, including:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        191.60549926757812,
        91.36740112304688,
        199.60549926757812
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        209.93359375,
        513.42919921875,
        223.28509521484375
      ],
      "text": "Development of a communication plan, including briefings for decision-makers in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        213.60549926757812,
        91.36740112304688,
        221.60549926757812
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        225.93011474609375,
        513.4291381835938,
        239.2816162109375
      ],
      "text": "the ministry of health, professional associations and donors, to ensure that consistent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        241.9266357421875,
        513.4520874023438,
        255.27813720703125
      ],
      "text": "messages are communicated to health care workers, community partners providing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        257.92315673828125,
        204.99899291992188,
        271.274658203125
      ],
      "text": "care, and the public.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        279.93359375,
        513.4406127929688,
        293.28509521484375
      ],
      "text": "Promotion of collaborative TB/HIV services and integration of care into relevant",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        283.6054992675781,
        91.36740112304688,
        291.6054992675781
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        295.93011474609375,
        270.56048583984375,
        309.2816162109375
      ],
      "text": "maternal and child health services",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        319.5941162109375,
        225.05538940429688,
        336.3221130371094
      ],
      "text": "Recording and reporting",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        343.3336181640625,
        513.4718627929688,
        356.68511962890625
      ],
      "text": "Accurate recording and reporting of TB (and HIV) in children are critically important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        359.3301086425781,
        513.426025390625,
        372.6816101074219
      ],
      "text": "for improved epidemiological surveillance, measuring the impact of interventions and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        375.32659912109375,
        513.4605102539062,
        388.6781005859375
      ],
      "text": "facilitating the planning and organization of paediatric services. Recording and reporting",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        391.3230895996094,
        513.46044921875,
        404.6745910644531
      ],
      "text": "are also relevant for defining the need for technical assistance and drug procurement",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        407.319580078125,
        513.4490966796875,
        420.67108154296875
      ],
      "text": "and to determine staff requirements. Children with TB should therefore always be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        423.3160705566406,
        377.5189514160156,
        436.6675720214844
      ],
      "text": "included in the routine NTP recording and reporting system.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        450.341064453125,
        213.58639526367188,
        463.96856689453125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 28 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        474.11602783203125,
        513.3067016601562,
        489.45001220703125
      ],
      "text": "All children treated for TB should be recorded and reported by NTP in one of",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        487.3160400390625,
        321.9173278808594,
        502.6500244140625
      ],
      "text": "two age bands (0–4 years and 5–14 years)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        512.8375244140625,
        459.88397216796875,
        526.1890258789062
      ],
      "text": "(This recommendation is not graded: it is based on good clinical practice)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        537.6430053710938,
        143.57638549804688,
        550.9945068359375
      ],
      "text": "Sources:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        562.3795776367188,
        513.4510498046875,
        575.800048828125
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        576.1795654296875,
        500.1800537109375,
        589.6000366210938
      ],
      "text": "in children.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2006 (WHO/HTM/ TB/2006.371)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        600.9850463867188,
        513.3935546875,
        614.405517578125
      ],
      "text": "Definitions and reporting framework for tuberculosis - 2013 revision.  Geneva, World",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        614.8540649414062,
        350.2199401855469,
        628.20556640625
      ],
      "text": "Health Organization, 2013 (WHO/HTM/TB/2013.2)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        639.590576171875,
        513.4048461914062,
        653.0110473632812
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  The age of the child is of particular importance as children are required by",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        652.7160034179688,
        299.7742004394531,
        668.0499877929688
      ],
      "text": ": WHO to be reported in two age groups",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        673.2374877929688,
        319.8879699707031,
        686.7039794921875
      ],
      "text": "0-4 years (up to 4 years and 11 months)  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        693.3068237304688,
        174.8039093017578,
        706.7733154296875
      ],
      "text": "5-14 years. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        729.3707885742188,
        406.2874755859375,
        742.7222900390625
      ],
      "text": "The 2013 case and outcome definitions are described in Annex 2.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        753.8773193359375,
        513.467529296875,
        767.2288208007812
      ],
      "text": "It is essential to notify the NTP of all identified TB cases in children, register them for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        769.8048095703125,
        513.386962890625,
        783.2252807617188
      ],
      "text": "(1) treatment and record their treatment outcome  . All children in whom TB treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
